{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><figcaption>銅鑼灣發生車禍。（fb「馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)」圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>銅鑼灣發生車禍。 今日（15日）下午1時許，一輛的士駕駛至銅鑼灣利園山道時，將一名老翁撞倒，老翁隨即受傷倒地，途人見狀立即上前協助並報警。警方和救援人員接報後趕至現場，由救護車將老翁送院治理。警方正在調查事件起因。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T08:24:48.124445+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":0,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T07:53:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T10:58:30.635937+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T08:17:59.302383+00:00","content_hash":"d05faf70fedaf2bca0666df035af29e75fdd6572f8dd399103fcc00466c64458","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}